# Testing (Vitest / Playwright)

- **Determinism:** No dependence on wall-clock, network randomness, or file order. Mock Gemini / PubMed / arXiv / IndexedDB / crypto (`@src/test/setup.ts`).
- **Forbidden:** Commenting out or deleting tests to make CI green. Fix the cause or tighten the assertion.
- **Isolation:** Specs run independently; no shared mutable globals across files.
- **E2E:** `src/test/e2e/` — prefer `getByRole`; `sleep` only with a written reason. Shared onboarding helpers live in `e2eHelpers.ts` (`skipOnboarding`, `completeOnboardingWithSampleTopic`).
- **Full local `pnpm run test:e2e` belongs in CI only** (~3.7 GB RAM local box — OOM risk). Locally run one spec or `-g "<pattern>"`. Blocking CI: Chromium + cross-browser use `docs/project-facts.json` `ciSpecPaths` (seven specs); `a11y.spec.ts` runs in `a11y.yml`.
- **Coverage:** Logic-layer floors in `@vitest.config.ts` (80/80/55/55 on `store` / `services` / `hooks` / `lib`). Prefer scoped `pnpm exec vitest run <file>` locally; read the full `test:coverage` gate from the blocking `deploy.yml` job.
- **Merge:** Tests green on the latest head are the CI half of the dual gate — not sufficient alone. Review quiescence: `docs/pr-merge-gate.md`.

See `@src/test/setup.ts`, `@vitest.config.ts`, `@docs/pr-merge-gate.md`.

<example>
`pnpm exec vitest run src/services/pubmedUtils.test.ts` while editing; confirm the deploy.yml coverage job on the PR before merge.
</example>

<example type="invalid">
`it.skip('retries on 429')` to silence a red CI job, or `pnpm run test:e2e` on the constrained local box.
</example>
